&lt;desc id="prot-ff-desc">Bonded terms are a chain of atoms and a torsion arrow. Electrostatics are a positive site and a negative site. Van der Waals contact is two spheres touching. The hydrophobic effect is two greasy groups with water around them, not between them.&lt;/desc>
